  - LineID: Story VI
    Speaker: Irene
    text: Also, I found this and wanted to give it to you, you deserve some fun after
      helping Reed with the leaves. If I remember correctly, there should be a chest
      in the shed you can use it on.
    lineTone: 1
    NPCGender: female
    NextLineID: End
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
